Subject: [PATCH] test(access): cover LoadingPredictor prefetch routing

Exercise PrefetchManager::Start through its production URL loader setup
against controlled origin and proxy servers. Assert native, selected
proxy, and missing-endpoint fail-closed routing after completion.

